{
  "name": "dsh-chat-gutter",
  "version": "0.2.19",
  "private": true,
  "description": "聊天区两侧标识带：右侧回合编号路标（锚定用户提问）、左侧合并过程徽标（⚙️工具 ⌨️命令 🤔思考计数）与回答起点琥珀高亮，输入区「快速移动」按钮弹出两列跳转面板（左列 AI 提问/工具/AI 回答/你的消息，右列编号与摘要），字号跟随界面字号。纯客户端，不依赖桌宠与图片素材。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/client.js",
    "lib/index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test \"tests/*.test.mjs\""
  },
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ]
    },
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-client-plugin",
    "chat",
    "gutter",
    "timeline",
    "web-ui"
  ]
}
